---
import HomeLayout from '../layouts/HomeLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/sections/PageHeader.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<HomeLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy | ${site.name}`}
  description="How Learners Academy collects, uses and protects the information you share with us — covering contact forms, analytics cookies and your rights over your data."
  canonical="/privacy/"
  topBar={false}
>
  <PageHeader eyebrow="Legal" crumb="Privacy" title="Privacy policy" />
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
        <p>
          Learners Academy ("we", "us", "our") provides online and in-person tuition for IGCSE, O Level and
          A Level students. This page explains what information we collect through this website, why we
          collect it, and what choices you have. Last updated 16 September 2026.
        </p>

        <h2>Information you give us</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit our contact form, book a free trial class, or message us on WhatsApp, we collect
          your name, email address, phone or WhatsApp number, the student’s class, grade or exam board, and
          any other details you choose to include. Where the student is a child, we ask that the enquiry is
          made by a parent or guardian.
        </p>
        <p>
          We use this only to reply to your enquiry, arrange a trial class, and schedule and deliver tuition.
          We may contact you by phone, email or WhatsApp using the details you provide. We do not sell your
          data and we do not use it for advertising.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiry records are kept for 24 months from your last contact with us, then deleted. Records for
          enrolled students are kept while the student studies with us and for 3 years afterwards, so that we
          can provide references, progress reports or transcripts if you need them later.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
        <p>
          We use Google Analytics 4 to count visits and see which pages families look at, and Microsoft
          Clarity to record anonymised session activity such as scrolling and clicks so we can find parts of
          the site that are confusing or broken.
        </p>
        <p>
          Neither runs until you accept. When you first visit, a bar at the bottom of the page asks for your
          choice. Until you choose Accept, no analytics cookie is set and Microsoft Clarity does not load at
          all. If you choose Reject, both stay switched off. Your choice is remembered in your browser, and
          you can change it at any time by clearing your browser storage for this site.
        </p>
        <p>
          Microsoft Clarity masks what you type into forms, so the text you enter is not captured in session
          recordings. Cloudflare hosts this website and protects our forms from automated abuse using
          Cloudflare Turnstile; this processes your IP address and basic request information and is necessary
          for the site to work.
        </p>

        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>
          We share your information only with the service providers that operate parts of this site for us —
          Google, Microsoft and Cloudflare — with our teachers where it is needed to schedule and deliver
          lessons, and with anyone we are legally required to share it with. We do not pass your details to
          other tuition providers, schools or marketing companies.
        </p>

        <h2>Where your information goes</h2>
        <p>
          We are based in Lahore, Pakistan, and your enquiry details are received and stored here. The
          analytics and hosting providers above process data on servers outside Pakistan, including in the
          United States and the European Union.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us for a copy of the information we hold about you, ask us to correct it or delete it,
          ask us to stop using it for a particular purpose, or object to analytics tracking. Email us and we
          will respond within 30 days. There is no charge. If you are in the UK or the EU and you are not
          satisfied with our response, you may complain to your national data protection authority.
        </p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>
          We teach students under 18. We ask that enquiries are made by a parent or guardian and we do not
          knowingly collect information directly from a child without a parent’s involvement. If you believe
          a child has given us information without your knowledge, email us and we will delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For any privacy request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</HomeLayout>

<style>
  .legal {
    background: var(--c-bg);
    padding-block: var(--section-y);
  }
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    margin: 32px 0 10px;
    font-size: 24px;
  }
  .legal p {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .legal a {
    color: var(--c-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .legal__note {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--c-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
